<title>UK: India sells 12 cargoes of ICUMSA sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>India sells 12 cargoes of ICUMSA sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India sold 12 cargoes of 60 and 100 ICUMSA sugar for October through March shipment, trade sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The sources said India was also considering the sale of another 12 cargoes.</p>
<p>India's sugar output has increased by almost 50 percent to 17.80 million tonnes raw value in the 1995/96 (Oct/Sept) season, according to the Indian Sugar Mills Association. --London newsroom +4471 542 79 28</p>
